OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy
OL,6,Fthrough the evening with some patchy
OL,7,Flight rain possible. Staying largely
OL,8,Fcloudy overnight with further
OL,9,Foutbreaks of light rain, but some
OL,10,Fclearer spells may develop around the
OL,11,FIsles. A milder night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FLargely cloudy with rain at
OL,14,Ftimes, likely turning heavier and more
OL,15,Fpersistent later. Quite breezy around
OL,16,Fthe coasts. Best chance of any dry,
OL,17,Fbright weather towards the Isles.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
