OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FLargely cloudy on Wednesday with rain
OL,7,Fat times, brightening up later. Bright
OL,8,Fspells and some showers on Thursday.
OL,9,FBecoming rather wet and windy on
OL,10,FFriday.
